+# Evidence ledger
+
+### Root cause: implicit-assumption
+The default selector assumed template filename extensions were lowercase.
+Fix: normalize the filename before checking the existing supported suffixes.
+Prevention: regression coverage includes mixed-case supported extensions.
+
+### Verify: Default autoescape recognizes supported extensions regardless of filename case; None and unsupported names retain their behavior.
